{
  "_id": "Uf1ixDybe1iuEJsQ",
  "name": "Crowned Kirin",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/HornedKirin_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have grown a pair of horns; one white and formed of life energy, and one black and formed of necrotic energy.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Soul</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Stride Speed</strong> increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Melee</strong>, <strong>Accuracy</strong> and <strong>Defense</strong> increase by 1.</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, when you would take <strong>Damage</strong>, you may drain the life from the aggressor to heal yourself for an amount equal to your <strong>Soul</strong>. This healing is subtracted from the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt, and the creature that would have inflicted it takes <strong>Damage</strong> equal to your <strong>Soul</strong>. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores Armor.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p>",
